<title>HONG KONG: Wah Ha Realty interim net jumps 200 pct.</title>
<headline>Wah Ha Realty interim net jumps 200 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended September 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   30.97	vs  10.32</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    3.0	  vs  2.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  24.86 gain vs  nil</p>
<p>    Net			    37.36	vs  12.49</p>
<p>    Turnover		     6.59	 vs  6.18</p>
<p>    Company name		 Wah Ha Realty Co Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  January 3-15, 1997</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   January 20, 1997</p>
<p>NOTE - Wah Ha Realty engages in investment holding, property investment and development.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain on disposal of investment properties held by two associated companies, including revaluation reserve realised upon disposal amounting to HK$12.1 million.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
